# THE PRODUCT™ — environment configuration
#
# Vite only exposes variables prefixed with VITE_ to client code. There are no
# required runtime secrets for this project; everything below is optional.
#
# The live project URL used by the README and by docs (not bundled anywhere
# that would leak it into a static build). When deploying to GitHub Pages you
# can set this to the resolved site URL so builds annotate the right origin.
VITE_SITE_URL=https://zazieproductions.github.io/Baudrillardian-Simulacra-in-Landing-Page-Conversion/

# Override the GitHub Pages base path (only relevant for `npm run build`).
# Default is '/' — the deploy workflow passes the real base automatically.
# VITE_BASE=/
